><mxCell style="rhombus;fillColor=#4a3aa7;strokeColor=#4a3aa7;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1066.8" y="699.5" width="7.0" height="7.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="" id="c158" link="https://data.consilium.europa.eu/doc/document/CM-3831-2026-INIT/en/pdf" tooltip="07 Sep 2026: Horizontal Working Party on Cyber Issues: Interplay between CADA and CSA21 – Presentation by the Commission … – CM 3831/26"><mxCell style="rhombus;fillColor=#4a3aa7;strokeColor=#4a3aa7;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1277.5" y="699.5" width="7.0" height="7.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="" id="c159" link="https://data.consilium.europa.eu/doc/document/CM-3845-2026-INIT/en/pdf" tooltip="10 Sep 2026: Horizontal Working Party on Cyber Issues: Cyber posture – Presentation by the Commission and discussion – CM 3845/26"><mxCell style="rhombus;fillColor=#4a3aa7;strokeColor=#4a3aa7;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290.4" y="699.5" width="7.0" height="7.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><UserObject label="" id="c160" link="https://data.consilium.europa.eu/doc/document/CM-4269-2026-INIT/en/pdf" tooltip="28 Sep 2026: Horizontal Working Party on Cyber Issues: Title IV (ICT Supply Chain) – Discussion (WK 14487/26 + ADD1) – CM 4269/26"><mxCell style="rhombus;fillColor=#4a3aa7;strokeColor=#4a3aa7;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1367.9" y="699.5" width="7.0" height="7.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="c161" value="Notes" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="794.0" width="200.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c162" value="• Status as of 25 Sep 2026: first reading, committee stage in the EP; no Council mandate for negotiations (not public). No trilogue has taken place." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="810.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c163" value="• The Directive amending NIS 2 (COM(2026) 13, procedure 2026/0012(COD)) is negotiated together with this Regulation in the Council (ST 9399/26 covers both)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="826.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c164" value="• Several Member States asked the Council Legal Service to examine the legal basis (ST 9399/26, point 16)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="842.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c165" value="Labels are shortened; the procedure page lists every event in full with its document and source. Sources: EP Open Data API (procedure events), Cellar procedure file, Council register documents and agendas, EUR-Lex. Our own compilation, not an official record." style="text;html=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#6f757b;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.0" y="860.0" width="1760.0" height="16.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
